WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:06.395
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: AI Makes Slides.

2
00:00:06.695 --> 00:00:11.960
Create a slide outline and build a presentation. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:19.680
Step one. Ask for the number of slides and bullets. For example, five slides, three short bullets each.

4
00:00:20.683 --> 00:00:25.927
Step two. Check the content. Remove anything you do not need or do not understand.

5
00:00:26.917 --> 00:00:31.496
Step three. Copy the text into PowerPoint, one slide at a time.

6
00:00:32.483 --> 00:00:38.923
Step four. Add pictures and use your own words. You will present it, so you must understand every slide.

7
00:00:39.917 --> 00:00:43.707
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:44.007 --> 00:00:48.247
Ask AI for a 5-slide outline on your topic.

9
00:00:48.547 --> 00:00:50.256
Build the slides in PowerPoint.

10
00:00:50.556 --> 00:00:52.614
Practise presenting in 3 minutes.

11
00:00:52.914 --> 00:00:53.985
Well done!

